    {
      "source": "Messages of type <a href=\"../messages/SystemMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.messages\"><code>SystemMessage</code></a> are treated specially: if a new\n<a href=\"../messages/SystemMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.messages\"><code>SystemMessage</code></a> is added, all previous <a href=\"../messages/SystemMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.messages\"><code>SystemMessage</code></a> instances are\nremoved from the memory. Also, if the total number of messages exceeds the limit, the\n<a href=\"../messages/SystemMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.messages\"><code>SystemMessage</code></a> messages are preserved while evicting other types of messages.",
      "translation": "类型为 <a href=\"../messages/SystemMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.messages\"><code>SystemMessage</code></a> 的消息会被特殊处理：如果添加了新的 <a href=\"../messages/SystemMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.messages\"><code>SystemMessage</code></a>，则内存中所有的先前 <a href=\"../messages/SystemMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.messages\"><code>SystemMessage</code></a> 实例都会被移除。此外，如果消息总数超过限制，系统将保留 <a href=\"../messages/SystemMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.messages\"><code>SystemMessage</code></a> 类型的消息，并驱逐其他类型的消息。",
      "count": 1
    },
